{2}│{R}{1}⦿ Remove otters defined in a manifest file                 {R}{2}│{R}
{2}├───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤{R}
{2}│{R}{3}▸ Usage:{R}                                                   {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}  {5}otter dmf rm     --file manifest.toml [box]{R}              {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}  {5}otter assemble remove --file manifest.toml [box]{R}         {2}│{R}
{2}├───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤{R}
{2}│{R}{3}▸ Examples:{R}                                                {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}  {5}otter dmf rm --file manifest.toml{R}                        {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}  {5}otter dmf rm -f manifest.toml my-box{R}                     {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}  {5}otter assemble remove -f manifest.toml my-box{R}            {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}  {5}otter assemble remove --file manifest.toml my-box{R}        {2}│{R}
{2}├───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤{R}
{2}│{R}{3}▸ Options:{R}                                                 {2}│{R}
{2}│{R} {4}--file{R}    {2}┆{R} {4}-f{R}  {5}Path to the manifest file (required){R}      {2}│{R}
{2}├───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤{R}
{2}│{R}{3}▸ Extras:{R}                                                  {2}│{R}
{2}│{R} {4}--help{R}    {2}┆{R} {4}-h{R}  {5}Show this help message{R}                    {2}│{R}
{2}├───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤{R}
{2}│{R}{3}▸ Notes:{R}                                                   {2}│{R}
{2}│{R} {5}When no [box] argument, all boxes in manifest are removed.{R}{2}│{R}
